 "meta": {
  "name": "units_range",
  "note": "Hand-chosen: the double range, which v1 refused a unit scale or a normalized value outside of and the Calculator keeps, decided on the exact value. 2^1024 - 2^970 and above is infinite as a double, 2^-1075 and below is zero (round to nearest, ties to even). Cases at each bound, just inside and just outside, with and without a power of pi; the expectations are exact (Python integers and fractions, pi from Machin's formula with an error bound). fn range takes an unevaluated product: bases (decimal strings) and exponents over num and den, and the power of pi."
 },
